{"seq":30,"slug":"product-management","title":"产品管理","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management","rating":{"composite":3.51,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 产品管理\n\n产品管理是关于「如何做对的事情」的学问。一个团队可以高效地交付一个产品，最终却发现根本没人需要它——把事情「做对」（高效交付）与做「对的事情」（打造有价值的产品），是两个截然不同的问题。产品经理站在用户、技术与商业的交汇点上，核心使命是确保团队所投入的宝贵时间与资源，被用于打造真正能为用户创造价值、为企业带来回报的产品。\n\n本知识库面向技术从业者——无论你是想转型产品的工程师、需要与产品经理协作的技术骨干，还是希望培养「产品思维」以让自己的工作真正创造价值的人。你无需产品管理背景，但需要对「如何打造出真正有价值的东西」这一问题抱有探究的热情。\n\n**基础与角色**界定产品管理的本质（决定打造什么）、产品经理的核心职责、「没有实权的领导」这一角色特征，以及它与项目经理等相邻角色的区别。\n\n**产品发现与用户研究**讲解「从问题出发而非方案先行」的原则、定性与定量的用户研究、透过表面诉求洞察本质需求，以及在打造前用低成本方式验证假设。\n\n**产品战略与路线图**剖析作为「北极星」的产品愿景、回答「如何取胜」的战略（聚焦与取舍），以及从「功能清单式」转向「目标导向式」的路线图。\n\n**优先级与取舍**深入产品管理最艰难的决策——权衡价值与成本、抵御「谁声音大听谁的」等陷阱，以及如何通过透明与逻辑沟通优先级。\n\n**执行、度量与意义**考察跨职能协作、从关注「交付」转向关注「价值」、用正确的指标度量成效、「打造—度量—学习」的迭代循环，并提炼产品思维的精髓与深远意义。\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读，它对应着产品从构思到演进的完整旅程：先发现真问题，再定方向、排优先级，最后执行、度量、迭代，并升华为一种通用的产品思维。阅读时不妨始终把握一条主线：在一个能高效造出各种东西的时代，「应该造什么、它是否真正有价值」这一根本追问，比以往任何时候都更重要。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与角色","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-product-management","title":"什么是产品管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/foundations/what-is-product-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pm-role-and-responsibilities","title":"产品经理的核心职责","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/foundations/pm-role-and-responsibilities"},{"seq":3,"slug":"leadership-without-authority","title":"没有实权的领导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/foundations/leadership-without-authority"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"discovery","title":"产品发现与用户研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/discovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"problem-first","title":"从问题出发，而非方案先行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/discovery/problem-first"},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-research","title":"用户研究：定性与定量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/discovery/user-research"},{"seq":3,"slug":"insight-and-validation","title":"洞察本质需求与验证假设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/discovery/insight-and-validation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"strategy","title":"产品战略与路线图","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vision-as-north-star","title":"作为北极星的产品愿景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/strategy/vision-as-north-star"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategy-focus-and-tradeoff","title":"战略：聚焦与取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/strategy/strategy-focus-and-tradeoff"},{"seq":3,"slug":"goal-oriented-roadmap","title":"从功能清单到目标导向的路线图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/strategy/goal-oriented-roadmap"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"prioritization","title":"优先级与取舍","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/prioritization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"value-vs-cost","title":"权衡价值与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/prioritization/value-vs-cost"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prioritization-traps","title":"优先级的陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/prioritization/prioritization-traps"},{"seq":3,"slug":"communicating-priorities","title":"沟通优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/prioritization/communicating-priorities"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"execution-and-significance","title":"执行、度量与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/execution-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-functional-collaboration","title":"跨职能协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/execution-and-significance/cross-functional-collaboration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"value-over-delivery-metrics","title":"从交付到价值：用对的指标度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/execution-and-significance/value-over-delivery-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"build-measure-learn","title":"打造—度量—学习的迭代循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/execution-and-significance/build-measure-learn"},{"seq":4,"slug":"product-thinking-and-significance","title":"产品思维与意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/product-management/execution-and-significance/product-thinking-and-significance"}]}]}